From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 18:09:52 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] scrobj: script components (resources, objects, variable
 properties, internalName) and Scriptlet.TypeLib

Parser: comments and the component processing instruction are skipped, the
component id attribute, an empty registration with remotable and its register /
unregister scripts (kept, not run), method / property / get / put internalName,
properties without get and put (a variable of the script), events, resource,
object, reference and implements elements, mixed text and CDATA in scripts, a
JScript default language. The global object has typeinfo count 0, createComponent
and getResource, fireEvent, and a complete IDispatchEx. A scriptlet instance
answers GetMemberProperties / GetMemberName / GetNextDispID / DeleteMember*. The
script site answers GetItemInfo for the component's objects and its other calls.
Scriptlet.TypeLib keeps Path, Doc, Name, MajorVersion, MinorVersion and GUID, and
Write creates the type library (a dispinterface and a coclass per component).

diff --git a/dlls/scrobj/Makefile.in b/dlls/scrobj/Makefile.in
index db95fa0..7feea25 100644
--- a/dlls/scrobj/Makefile.in
+++ b/dlls/scrobj/Makefile.in
@@ -1,5 +1,5 @@
 MODULE    = scrobj.dll
-IMPORTS   = uuid urlmon ole32 oleaut32 xmllite advapi32
+IMPORTS   = uuid urlmon ole32 oleaut32 xmllite advapi32 user32
 
 EXTRADLLFLAGS = -Wb,--prefer-native
 
diff --git a/dlls/scrobj/scrobj.c b/dlls/scrobj/scrobj.c
index 5056977..21c4551 100644
